  "body": "<a name=\"release-1-18-7-security\"></a>\n\n### Security\n\n- Require pip 26.2.2 or later in the shared libraries, and replace an older shared pip on the next pipx command instead of waiting for the 30-day refresh. Older pip releases bundle a certifi that still trusts the compromised eMudhra/emSign root CA ([#2197](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2197)) by @gaborbernat.\n\n[PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/pipx/1.18.7/)\n\n[Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/compare/1.18.6...1.18.7)\n",
